{{Term/Store|Naydra's Claw|Naydra's Claws|Series, BotW, TotK|plural}} are recurring [[Item]]s in {{TLoZ Series}}.<ref>{{Cite|{{Big|Naydra's Claw}}<br/>This valuable claw was plucked from the blue spirit Naydra. It was freezing cold before it was removed. You could sell it, but there must be some other use for it.|Inventory|BotW}}</ref><ref>{{Cite|{{Big|Naydra's Claw}}<br/>This valuable claw was once nearly frozen. Attach it to a weapon to greatly increase its attack power. It can be cooked or sold for some rupees.|Inventory|TotK}}</ref>

==Location and Uses==
==={{BotW|-}}===
Naydra's Claws can be obtained by shooting the claws of [[Naydra]] as it flies by. Naydra can be found on [[Mount Lanayru]], from which it will fly down to either the [[Lanayru Promenade]] or [[Lanayru Bay]]. When [[Cooking]] with Naydraw's Claws, the resulting meal will always be [[Dubious Food]]. Naydra's Claws can be used at the [[Kochi Dye Shop]] to make Light Blue [[Dye]].

Two Claws, as well as five [[Courser Bee Honey]]s, are needed to upgrade the [[Tunic of the Wild]] to its second tier at a [[Great Fairy Fountain]]. One can also be used to upgrade the [[Fierce Deity Armor]] to its second tier.
